{"id":"8bcffbad5888","publishedAt":1795277116000,"posts":[[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/itsoku/imgs/9/c/9cf01482.png"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"Amazonは、音楽聴き放題サービス「AmazonMusic Unlimited」の最初の3ヶ月無料キャンペーンを開始しました。対象者は下記ページで確認できます。おそらくたくさんの人が対象です！"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"href":"https://link.amazon/A05aw3MQ7","text":"https://link.amazon/A05aw3MQ7"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"期間は2027年1月11日まで。3ヶ月無料は激アツキャンペーンです。対象の人はお早めにっ！"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"また、現在開催中のAudbleのキャンペーンも灼熱です、お見逃しなく！"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/itsoku/imgs/d/c/dc22fb09.jpg"},{"color":"#2d7ff9","href":"https://itsoku.org/archives/63617271.html","size":12,"bold":true,"text":"関連記事"},{"color":"#8a94a6","href":"https://itsoku.org/archives/63617271.html","size":12,"bold":true,"text":"IT速報"},{"color":"#222","href":"https://itsoku.org/archives/63617271.html","size":16,"bold":true,"text":"【緊急】Amazon、Audbleが最初の3ヶ月99円＋500円分のアマギフもらえる神キャンペーンを開催"},{"br":1},{"color":"#888","size":12,"text":"※本記事はアフィリエイト広告を含みます。セール情報は記事掲載時点のものです"},{"br":1},{"text":"以下一部"},{"br":1},{"text":"\\"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"詳細："},{"bold":true,"href":"https://link.amazon/A05aw3MQ7","text":"https://link.amazon/A05aw3MQ7"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/itsoku/imgs/d/c/dc22fb09.jpg"},{"color":"#2d7ff9","href":"https://itsoku.org/archives/63617271.html","size":12,"bold":true,"text":"関連記事"},{"color":"#8a94a6","href":"https://itsoku.org/archives/63617271.html","size":12,"bold":true,"text":"IT速報"},{"color":"#222","href":"https://itsoku.org/archives/63617271.html","size":16,"bold":true,"text":"【緊急】Amazon、Audbleが最初の3ヶ月99円＋500円分のアマギフもらえる神キャンペーンを開催"}]],"comments":[]}